


### get all loans
GET http://localhost:3000/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json


### get a specific loan
GET http://localhost:3000/api/loans/1
Content-Type: application/json


### post new loan
POST http://localhost:3000/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reader_id": 1,
    "book_id": 1,
    "loan_date": "2024-06-01",
    "return_date": "2024-06-15"
}


### update loan
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/loans/60
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reader_id": 1,
    "book_id": 1,
    "loan_date": "2024-06-01",
    "return_date": "2024-06-20"
}

### delete loan
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/loans/1
Content-Type: application/json


### return loan
POST http://localhost:3000/api/loans/2/return
Content-Type: application/json
